    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n76212" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀχ-ή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>prop, support</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
			</span></i><i>Fr.anon.</i><i><span class="en">
				48
			</span></i> (in poet. form <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀκχή</span>, cf.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄφις</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>support, food</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				482
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				8.363b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀχῆς</span>
			
				contr.
			 gen., for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀχεῆς</span>, 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀχεά</span>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀχεία</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arat.
				1069
			</span></i>.</div>
